//! tr kodlu 3 dil=en
// Error 19 — File not found.
// Message code: H2100
// What happens: Reading a file that does not exist raises an error at run time; the message lists the places it looked.
// Why: The path is misspelled or the file is not in the folder you are in.
// Fixed version:
//     if path("missing_file.txt").exists {
//         print(read_file("missing_file.txt"))
//     }
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/19_file_not_found.tr   (exit code 1)

TR_fn_print(TR_fn_read_file("missing_file.txt"))
